hypothesize.prompt_template:
Generate safety signal hypotheses for:
  Product name: {product_name}
  Product type: {product_type}
  Data source: {data_source}

Consider: adverse event trends, disproportionate reporting of serious outcomes (death, hospitalization, disability), potential label gaps, therapeutic class comparisons, known pharmacological mechanisms, and at-risk populations.

write_code.prompt_template:
Write a Python script to investigate this hypothesis:
  Product: {product_name} ({product_type})
  Hypothesis: {hypothesis_title}
  Method: {hypothesis_method}
  Rationale: {hypothesis_rationale}
  openFDA endpoint: {endpoint_url}
  Search field: {search_field}{error_section}
